 "what": "The temperature sweep's Llama runs before the shim fix, kept as evidence of the bug, not as results. Each install's shim had been started by a short pi run whose egress proxy then exited; the shim borrowed the newest port file's proxy, which belonged to another short run and closed mid-request.",
