 "verified": "install E, 2026-11-11T20:45Z: a full bootstrap left no shim; three Llama tool runs through one shim whose starting session and proxy had gone answered 4721, 4722, 4723 with no turn errors; an old-code shim started with no proxy (as bootstrap.sh had left on the user's machine) was replaced by the next session, which answered 4729 through a new shim with proxyManaged and callerProxy true",
